          "urpx:name": "Eligibility for Schedule AEA Residential Energy Advantage Service",
          "urpx:description": "At the customer's request, for all domestic uses of a residential service meeting the qualifications of the Cooperative's incentive residential programs (Right Choice, Comfort Home and Good Cents) when supplied through one meter, as the Cooperative's Service Rules and Regulations define a residential service; the qualifications are set forth in the Cooperative's current program specifications. Available to all qualified customers in the area served by the Cooperative.",
